.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.local
.env
# NOTE: `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) is deliberate — a bare directory
# exclude blocks git from descending into it at all, which makes the
# negation carve-out below a no-op (a known git gitignore limitation:
# you cannot re-include paths under an excluded *directory*, only under
# excluded *contents*). `.claude/*` ignores the same set of top-level
# entries but still lets negated sub-patterns re-include specific paths.
.claude/*
.worktrees/

# Repo-local dev agent (NEVER packaged/shipped — see g-dev/README.md and
# .claude/agents/g-forge-dev.md's own header). Everything else under
# .claude/ stays ignored (it's this machine's installed copy of the
# plugin dogfooding itself); this is the sole carve-out.
!.claude/agents/
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/g-forge-dev.md

# G-Forge operational artifacts — NOT project record (not plugin content). Two classes
# below: the *installed artifact* (CLAUDE.md) and *regenerable raw output* (the rest).
# Tracking now lives under g-docs/ and IS committed (g-docs/ROADMAP.md, g-docs/todo.md,
# g-docs/todo-done.md, g-docs/milestones/, decisions/, retros/, …).
#
# `/CLAUDE.md` stays ignored deliberately (decided 2026-07-26, after considering and
# rejecting a negation carve-out): in this repo it is the *installed artifact* of the
# plugin dogfooding itself, the same class as `.claude/`. Note this deviates from what
# /g-init tells consumer projects (Step 5a, skills/g-init/SKILL.md:168, classifies
# CLAUDE.md as tracked project record) — deliberately, because there the file is not an
# install artifact of the tree it sits in.
#
# THE INJECTION RULE. Durability is bought by making the injections airtight, not by
# tracking the artifact: every load-bearing line in CLAUDE.md must be (a) inside a
# G-Forge marker block fed from committed plugin source, (b) an `@`-import of a committed
# file, or (c) explicitly declared local-only (the voice-profile import is the one
# sanctioned instance of (c) — personal, never published). Bare prose asserting facts
# about the tree is the defect: it is what was lost on 2026-07-10, and what let the
# per-suite test table sit at a stale 522 while the real suite had moved to 523.
# Fix the injection, never the .gitignore.
/CLAUDE.md
g-docs/plans/
g-docs/agent-output/
g-docs/superpowers/
